 "remarks": "This charming storybook vintage classic, in the heart of New Canaan, is waiting for its new owner to make it their own. The generous sized rooms are full of character, architectural interest, beautiful natural light and original hardwood floors. The elegant and gracious living room with gorgeous period windows, fireplace and built-ins is stunning. Through pretty French doors, the dining room opens into a delightful screened porch with a skylit cathedral ceiling. The kitchen is adjacent to the step-down family room with high ceilings, bay window and door accessing the brick terrace. The circa 1900 barn has endless possibilities. Sited on a beautiful private lot with lovely gardens, this magical home offers a special opportunity for in-town living.",
